        Standard concept groups created:
        - feminine_gender (is_female)
        - masculine_gender (is_male)
        - head_of_household (is_head)
        - pregnant_eligible (is_pregnant)
        - climate_hazards
        - geophysical_hazards
        - children
        - adults
        - elderly
        - persons_with_disability

        To add codes to a concept group, use the UI or data files like:

        <record id="group_feminine_gender_codes" model="spp.vocabulary.concept.group">
            <field name="id" ref="spp_cel_vocabulary.group_feminine_gender"/>
            <field name="code_ids" eval="[(4, ref('your_module.your_female_code'))]"/>
        </record>

        ADR-016 Phase 3: CEL Integration
    -->
</odoo>
